1
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,625
Plate seven. The honeybee: Apis mellifera.

2
00:00:09,725 --> 00:00:15,100
Each eye is built from more than five thousand facets, and every one of them is a lens.

3
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,475
In flight, a row of tiny hooks locks the two wings into one.

4
00:00:19,575 --> 00:00:23,451
And on the hind leg, a basket, for carrying pollen home.

5
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:31,129
A lifetime of such work makes a twelfth of a teaspoon of honey.
